+# Code of conduct
+
+We want this to be a friendly, welcoming project for everyone, whatever their
+experience, background or identity.
+
+- Be respectful and patient; assume good intent.
+- Give constructive, specific feedback on work, never on people.
+- No harassment, insults, discrimination or unwanted personal attention.
+- Never share other people's voices, recordings or personal data without their permission.
+
+Maintainers may remove comments or contributions that break these rules and may block
+repeat offenders. To report a problem privately, contact the maintainer through the email
+on their GitHub profile.
