-## Quick start
+Most AI voice tools upload your scripts and recordings to someone else's server and charge per character. Hamza Voice Studio does the whole job on **127.0.0.1**:
 
-Requirements: Python 3.11, Node.js 20+, FFmpeg on PATH.
+- 🔒 **Private.** Your scripts and audio never leave your machine. No telemetry, no accounts.
+- 💸 **Free to run.** After a one-time model download (334 MB), generation costs nothing.
+- ✈️ **Offline.** Works without internet once the model is installed.
+- 🎬 **Made for production, not just demos.** Segments, takes, regeneration, chapters, crash-safe jobs and clean exports.
