+## ✨ Features
+
+| | |
+|---|---|
+| 📝 **Script editor** | Chapters and segments (split by paragraph or sentence), autosave, undo/redo, draft recovery after a crash, reordering, splitting |
+| 🗣️ **Offline speech** | [Kokoro-82M](https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M) (Apache-2.0) via [sherpa-onnx](https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx): 53 built-in voices, speed control, **faster than real time on a 2-core CPU** |
+| 🎞️ **Takes** | Several takes per segment, choose the best one, regenerate a single segment; takes made from older text are flagged |
+| 🔢 **Smart text** | Preview what will actually be spoken: `Rs. 2,500` → "two thousand five hundred rupees", dates, times, URLs, abbreviations, plus a per-project pronunciation dictionary |
+| 🌐 **RTL & mixed scripts** | Full Urdu/Arabic right-to-left editing, mixed Urdu/English text, a Roman Urdu → Urdu script helper |
+| 📦 **Export** | WAV/MP3, correct segment order, pauses, chapter gaps, optional EBU R128 loudness normalisation; exports never overwrite existing files |
+| ⚙️ **Durable jobs** | Real progress, cancel, retry, survives worker crashes and app restarts, live updates over SSE |
+| 🎤 **Voice library** | Upload or record reference audio, quality checks, **consent records**, trim, rename, revoke (ready for voice cloning engines) |
+| 🧩 **Model manager** | Code and weight licences shown separately; checksum-pinned downloads only after you approve; resumable, atomic installs |
+| 🌗 **Polished UI** | Dark/light themes, keyboard accessible, waveform player |
