-## Privacy
-
-Everything runs on `127.0.0.1`. There is no telemetry. The network is used only for model
-downloads you approve. Only use voices you own or have permission to use.
+| Generation speed | ~7 s of work per 10 s of audio (median real-time factor 0.69) |
+| Cold model load | 2.75 s |
+| Peak RAM | ~0.75 GB |
+| Reliability | **100 / 100** jobs completed in a stress run |
+| Crash recovery | worker killed mid-generation → recovered, no duplicate audio |
+
+Details: [docs/BENCHMARKS.md](docs/BENCHMARKS.md). Your hardware will differ; run `scripts/benchmark.py`.
+
+## 🧠 How it works
+
+```
+React UI ──HTTP/SSE──▶ FastAPI (127.0.0.1, session token)
+                          │  SQLite (projects, takes, durable jobs)
+                          ▼
+                     Worker process ──▶ sherpa-onnx ──▶ Kokoro-82M (ONNX, CPU)
+                          │
+                          └──▶ FFmpeg (assembly, MP3 export)
+```
+
+- Inference never blocks the API: it runs in a supervised worker process with atomic job claiming and leases.
+- Engines plug in through an adapter interface; the UI only shows controls the engine really supports.
+- More detail: [ARCHITECTURE](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md) · [API](docs/API.md) · [SECURITY](docs/SECURITY.md) · [TESTING](docs/TESTING.md).
+
