+- No voice cloning yet; the current model uses built-in voices.
+- English (US/UK) is verified; other languages are experimental. Urdu has no evaluated voice yet, though the editor fully supports Urdu text.
+- See [docs/IMPLEMENTATION_STATUS.md](docs/IMPLEMENTATION_STATUS.md) for the full status.
