+# Security policy
+
+Please **do not open a public issue** for security problems. Use GitHub's
+"Report a vulnerability" (Security → Advisories) on this repository, or email the
+maintainer via their GitHub profile. You should get a reply within 7 days.
+
+In scope: the local API (token, origin and host checks), file handling and path
+traversal, upload and archive processing, the Electron preload/IPC bridge.
+
+The design and existing protections are documented in [docs/SECURITY.md](docs/SECURITY.md).
